@startuml
title Alarm Clock Statechart

[*] --> Off : «M» System Initialization/

state Off {
}

state Active {
    state Ringing
}

Off --> Active : «M» Set Alarm Time/
Active --> Ringing : «M» Current Time Matches Alarm Time/
Ringing --> Active : «M» Stop Alarm/
Active --> [*] : «M» System Shutdown/
Ringing --> [*] : «M» System Crash/

@enduml
